WEBVTT

00:12:29.119 --> 00:12:32.080
We spoke with high-level
government officials

00:12:32.122 --> 00:12:34.875
who complained that this land
was too valuable

00:12:34.917 --> 00:12:37.211
to be wasted on educating girls.

00:12:37.753 --> 00:12:39.797
And we convinced them otherwise.

00:12:48.388 --> 00:12:50.516
Those officials,

00:12:50.557 --> 00:12:52.684
of course, aren't in government anymore.

00:12:53.393 --> 00:12:55.771
Afghanistan has new leaders.

00:12:57.606 --> 00:13:00.234
And while this is a sensitive topic,